    "Name": "Ti Ts'ang TSG-10L",
    "Details": "This Ti Ts'ang variant is protected by Heat-Dissipating Armor. It uses an XXL engine for power and uses an Endo-Composite skeleton. A chaff pod interferes with targeting systems. It retains the Hatchet, TAG, and Triple Strength Myomer of the basic model, and carries four Small Lasers and a Medium Variable Speed Pulse Laser in the left arm. Four Medium Lasers are mounted in the torso.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Hyper-Extending Actuators</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.08</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limit: Left Lower</color>",
